@startuml

actor "Usuário com baixa familiaridade digital" as Usuario

participant "Bulbinho" as Bulbinho
participant "Controller" as Controller
participant "Service" as Service
participant "Repository" as Repository

Usuario -> Bulbinho: Aciona ajuda contextual
Bulbinho -> Controller: Solicita dica da tela
Controller -> Service: Busca dica contextual
Service -> Repository: Consulta dica
Repository --> Service: Retorna dica
Service --> Controller: Retorna dica
Controller --> Bulbinho: Retorna dica
Bulbinho --> Usuario: Exibe dica contextual

@enduml